      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i want to get more specific with the \"look\" of them though. since they're meant to feel \"exotic\" and different from the empire's people, what kind of physical traits or skin tones should i give them to make them feel more \"other\" or primal? like, how can i visually signal to the reader that they belong to a different, more untamed part of the world through their physical appearance?",
